guage, superficial -ing  │                        │\n│           │                  │ analyses, vague                                             │                        │\n│           │                  │ attributions, em dash overuse, rule of three, AI            │                        │\n│           │                  │ vocabulary words, negative                                  │                        │\n│           │                  │ parallelisms, and excessive conjunctive phrases.            │                        │\n│ ✗ missing │ 📍 local-places   │ Search for places (restaurants, cafes, etc.) via Google     │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ Places API proxy on localhost.                              │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 process-watch  │ Monitor system processes - CPU, memory, disk I/O, network,  │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ open files, ports. Find resource hogs, kill runaway         │                        │\n│           │                  │ processes, track what's consuming your machine.             │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 prompt-guard   │ Advanced prompt injection defense system for Clawdbot.      │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ Protects against direct/indirect injection attacks in       │                        │\n│           │                  │ group chats with multi-language detection (EN/KO/JA/ZH),    │                        │\n│           │                  │ severity scoring, automatic logging, and configurable       │                        │\n│           │                  │ security policies. Use in any group context to restrict     │                        │\n│           │                  │ sensitive commands to owner and detect manipulation         │                        │\n│           │                  │ attempts.                                                   │                        │\n│ ✓ ready  